          "en": "Use when reasoning about erpax's production hardware — the Cloudflare edge (Worker isolate, D1, R2, Durable Objects) has hard limits, and CLOUDFLARE_LIMITS declares them with sources. productionCapacity(cwd) computes erpax's demand vs each; the decisive one is the 80MB skill index against the 3MB Worker script limit (27× over), deployable only because it is never bundled. assertFitsProduction refuses a deploy where the worker entry imports the index — the discipline made a theorem. Models the ceiling; the actual built artifact needs a build to measure."
