          "en": "Use when the gated commit/push must be achieved BY THE ROSETTA — every folder is an agent (a form·code·proof trinity that declares its @standard banners and either proves them or not), and the security/standards lanes for publish are DERIVED from that incidence, never hand-typed. The moving rosetta: poles come from what the folders declare, so a new atom joins a lane with no edit."
