          "en": "Use when modelling the gathering of matured output from a growth process — the IAS-41 transformation event where a biological asset becomes inventory, and the per-week harvest window (the produce calendar) over which a crop yields. Harvest is the realization point: value created by living growth crosses into sellable stock; the window is non-uniform — a 1 in the calendar marks presence, not constant volume."
